WEBVTT

NOTE
This is the opening exterior establishing shot of Balamb Garden.
Squall has just left the infirmary and the player sees the Garden for the first time.
Duration: approximately 22 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
The camera pans across the exterior of Balamb Garden, a massive futuristic educational facility. The structure is built on a circular base with a prominent central tower rising high into the sky. The architecture is sleek and modern, featuring smooth curved surfaces and gleaming white and metallic paneling. The circular ring-shaped structure extends outward from the central tower like a giant disc.

00:05.000 --> 00:11.000
Lush greenery and landscaped gardens surround the base of the Garden. Water features and reflective pools dot the grounds. The camera reveals the sheer scale of the facility as it pulls back further. Students in their blue SeeD cadet uniforms can be seen walking the pathways and grounds below. They appear as small figures against the massive architecture.

00:11.000 --> 00:16.000
The sky overhead is a brilliant blue with white fluffy clouds drifting peacefully. The lighting is bright and clear, suggesting daytime. The sun bathes the entire scene in natural light, casting subtle shadows across the Garden's modern surfaces.

00:16.000 --> 00:22.000
The camera continues its sweeping pan, revealing the full grandeur of Balamb Garden from multiple angles. The facility dominates the landscape, a testament to the advanced technology and resources of the Galbadian military's elite SeeD program. The establishing shot emphasizes the impressive scale and pristine condition of this iconic location.
